options.risks_conflicts:
- Changing a criterion after it failed is a forking path. Mitigations:
  - the FAIL is reported verbatim;
  - the new criteria are pre-registered before any measurement run;
  - the screen numbers are labelled post hoc.
- Does not satisfy R-3 if R-3 is a design principle.
- No conflict with D-2 or D-5.
